# ─── Concurrency: union-merge only for genuinely append-only archives ─────────
# The built-in `union` driver preserves both sides without understanding truth.
# Never apply it to bounded current digests or correction canon: doing so can
# silently reattach stale history or duplicate IDs after a clean rebase.
00-navigation/TANGENTS.md               merge=union
00-navigation/INVESTIGATION-BACKLOG.md  merge=union
00-navigation/OPEN-QUESTIONS.md         merge=union
00-navigation/CONCURRENT-SESSIONS.md    merge=union
05-knowledge/results/INDEX.md           merge=union
05-knowledge/variables/INDEX.md         merge=union
